---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="Contact | Post Viral Recovery"
			description="Get in touch with questions, feedback, or suggestions for tools and content. Run by a post-viral patient, not a clinician."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<div class="page-header">
				<h1>Contact</h1>
				<p class="subtitle">Questions, feedback, or tool requests</p>
			</div>

			<div class="content">
				<p>This site is run by one person: a post-viral patient, not a clinician. I read everything sent to me and try to respond, though it may take a few days.</p>

				<p>Good reasons to get in touch include:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Requests for new tools or tracking templates</li>
					<li>Suggestions for evidence topics you would find useful</li>
					<li>New papers I should read</li>
					<li>Corrections or updates to existing content</li>
					<li>General questions about the site or the conditions it covers</li>
					<li>If you have any suggestions for me. I am on a long road to recovery and would love to hear your thoughts if you have them.</li>
				</ul>

				<p>While I will try to be useful, please do not ask me for personal medical advice. I am not a clinician and cannot advise on individual symptoms or treatments. For medical questions, please speak to your doctor or a relevant specialist.</p>

				<div data-fs-success class="form-success" style="display:none">
					<p>Thanks for getting in touch. I will get back to you within a few days.</p>
				</div>
				<div data-fs-error class="form-error" style="display:none"></div>

				<form id="contact-form" class="contact-form">
					<div class="field">
						<label for="name">Name</label>
						<input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required data-fs-field />
						<span class="field-error" data-fs-error="name"></span>
					</div>
					<div class="field">
						<label for="email">Email address</label>
						<input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="your@email.com" required data-fs-field />
						<span class="field-error" data-fs-error="email"></span>
					</div>
					<div class="field">
						<label for="subject">Subject</label>
						<select id="subject" name="subject" data-fs-field>
							<option value="">Please select</option>
							<option value="tool-request">Tool or tracker request</option>
							<option value="content-suggestion">Content suggestion</option>
							<option value="correction">Correction or update</option>
							<option value="general">General question</option>
							<option value="other">Other</option>
						</select>
						<span class="field-error" data-fs-error="subject"></span>
					</div>
					<div class="field">
						<label for="message">Message</label>
						<textarea id="message" name="message" rows="6" placeholder="Your message..." required data-fs-field></textarea>
						<span class="field-error" data-fs-error="message"></span>
					</div>
					<button type="submit" class="submit-button" data-fs-submit-btn>Send message</button>
				</form>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />

		<script>
			window.formspree = window.formspree || function () { (formspree.q = formspree.q || []).push(arguments); };
			formspree('initForm', { formElement: '#contact-form', formId: 'xdapllow' });
		</script>
		<script src="https://unpkg.com/@formspree/ajax@1" defer></script>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.page-header {
		padding-bottom: 1.5em;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
		margin-bottom: 2em;
	}
	.page-header h1 { margin: 0.3em 0 0.1em; }
	.subtitle { color: rgb(var(--gray)); font-size: 1.05em; margin: 0; }

	.content {
		max-width: 640px;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.content p { margin-bottom: 1.25em; }
	.content ul {
		margin: 0 0 1.25em 1.25em;
		padding: 0;
	}
	.content li { margin-bottom: 0.4em; }

	.form-success {
		background: #f0faf4;
		border: 1px solid #b6dfc8;
		border-radius: 6px;
		padding: 1em 1.25em;
		margin-bottom: 1.5em;
		color: #1a5c35;
	}
	.form-success p { margin: 0; }

	.form-error {
		background: #fff5f5;
		border: 1px solid #fcc;
		border-radius: 6px;
		padding: 1em 1.25em;
		margin-bottom: 1.5em;
		color: #c0392b;
		font-size: 0.9em;
	}

	.contact-form {
		margin-top: 2em;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.25em;
	}
	.field {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.35em;
	}
	.field label {
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 0.95em;
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
	}
	.field input,
	.field select,
	.field textarea {
		padding: 0.55em 0.75em;
		border: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.95em;
		font-family: inherit;
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
		background: #fff;
		width: 100%;
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}
	.field input:focus,
	.field select:focus,
	.field textarea:focus {
		outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
		border-color: transparent;
	}
	.field input[aria-invalid="true"],
	.field select[aria-invalid="true"],
	.field textarea[aria-invalid="true"] {
		border-color: #c0392b;
	}
	.field textarea { resize: vertical; }
	.field-error {
		font-size: 0.85em;
		color: #c0392b;
	}

	.submit-button {
		align-self: flex-start;
		padding: 0.6em 1.75em;
		background: var(--accent);
		color: #fff;
		border: none;
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 1em;
		font-family: inherit;
		font-weight: 700;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: background 0.15s;
	}
	.submit-button:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); }
	.submit-button:disabled {
		opacity: 0.6;
		cursor: not-allowed;
	}
</style>
